WEBVTT

00:04.340 --> 00:08.370
So... why are you dressed like that?

00:08.370 --> 00:13.560
Since elves stand out, disguising 
ourselves as beasts allow us to blend in.

00:13.560 --> 00:15.040
These are amazing!

00:15.040 --> 00:17.150
They act like the real thing once equipped.

00:17.150 --> 00:19.990
You called them cosplay items, did you not?

00:19.990 --> 00:23.050
They have the ability to conceal 
the traits of one's species.

00:23.050 --> 00:24.710
Er, yeah, that's right.

00:25.260 --> 00:30.210
<i>I never dreamed stuff I mostly made 
for a laugh would come in so handy.</i>

00:30.530 --> 00:33.060
By the way, Shin, what do you think?

00:33.840 --> 00:35.090
Of what?

00:35.090 --> 00:37.090
Do they look good on me?

00:37.410 --> 00:41.100
Oh, yeah. You look great.

00:42.260 --> 00:45.150
W-We're going to see Schweid, aren't we?

00:45.150 --> 00:46.220
Let us hurry.

00:49.360 --> 00:51.890
I've never seen her like this before.

00:51.890 --> 00:53.370
Me either.

00:54.200 --> 00:57.740
<i>That aside, I didn't think
 I'd get to see </i>him<i> here.</i>

00:58.580 --> 01:02.530
<i>Kilmont is an allied nation of Farnid.</i>

01:02.530 --> 01:05.580
<i>And representing them at the funeral...</i>

01:06.210 --> 01:10.560
<i>was my former support character 
Schweid the high dragnir.</i>

02:44.820 --> 02:48.020
Representatives of the various 
nations are staying here.

02:52.020 --> 02:55.900
Is Schweid a monarch like Girart?

02:56.320 --> 03:01.110
No. Though he was the first emperor
of the Dragon Empire, Kilmont,

03:01.110 --> 03:03.160
he's cut ties with the imperial family.

03:03.760 --> 03:07.910
Ever since Kilmont stabilized, 
he has been living at his leisure.

03:08.400 --> 03:10.540
I'm surprised the people accepted that.

03:10.540 --> 03:14.640
The second and current emperor 
was originally meant to be the first,

03:14.640 --> 03:16.670
but he was injured during
the nation's founding.

03:16.950 --> 03:19.420
So Schweid was just a stand-in, huh?

03:19.970 --> 03:24.180
I shall fetch Lord Schweid. Please wait here.

03:24.490 --> 03:27.540
I have a meeting to attend, 
so I will be on my way.

03:28.220 --> 03:30.430
Please let Cuore know if you need anything.

03:40.690 --> 03:42.300
You are dismissed.

03:49.430 --> 03:51.710
Uh, long time no see?

03:54.940 --> 03:58.520
I am delighted that you have returned.

03:58.930 --> 04:03.840
I shall serve you once more 
and be the spear that pierces your foes.

04:03.870 --> 04:07.100
<i>Ah, right. He's </i>that<i> kind of guy.</i>

04:07.100 --> 04:11.660
Listen, I'll tell you what I told Schnee.
We finally get to see each other again.

04:11.660 --> 04:13.600
Let's take it easy, okay?

04:14.880 --> 04:15.850
However...

04:16.220 --> 04:20.610
Schweid, if Shin says it's okay,
 then it's okay.

04:20.990 --> 04:23.410
Not "Master," but "Shin"?

04:23.880 --> 04:25.610
That's different.

04:26.120 --> 04:26.810
Yes.

04:27.240 --> 04:32.540
Very well. If that is how things are,
I shall conduct myself at ease.

04:32.540 --> 04:36.500
By the way, Schnee, 
why are you dressed like that?

04:36.920 --> 04:38.440
To suit Shin's tastes.

04:38.440 --> 04:41.760
Could you not give him the wrong idea?

04:44.640 --> 04:48.260
I see. So Girart passed on a satisfied man.

04:48.650 --> 04:50.510
That sounds just like him.

04:50.940 --> 04:53.520
A warrior until the very end.

04:55.920 --> 04:58.780
So, Shin, what will you do now?

05:00.420 --> 05:02.680
I've researched all I can
at the libraries here,

05:02.680 --> 05:04.320
so I'll hit the sacred place next.

05:04.760 --> 05:07.330
I will be returning to Kilmont.

05:07.330 --> 05:09.160
Allow me to join you after that.

05:09.600 --> 05:12.000
It's been a while since we partied up.

05:12.000 --> 05:15.170
Indeed. We can use telepathy
to keep in contact.

05:15.780 --> 05:18.380
Welp, we'd better get going.

05:18.920 --> 05:20.740
Oh, that's right.

05:24.700 --> 05:26.180
It can't be! Is that...

05:26.180 --> 05:29.800
Yup. It's your personal weapon, Nagizuki.

05:30.330 --> 05:32.390
It's been ages since I held it last,

05:32.390 --> 05:34.560
but nothing could feel
more natural in my hands.

05:34.560 --> 05:38.180
I took care of the maintenance for you.
See for yourself.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.620
Impressive work.

05:41.130 --> 05:44.820
Though it seems more powerful 
than the Nagizuki I know.

05:45.400 --> 05:46.760
You can tell?

05:46.760 --> 05:51.280
My mana control has improved 
since I repaired Girart's equipment.

05:51.280 --> 05:53.580
Thanks to that, 
she's now five times stronger!

05:53.840 --> 05:57.410
Your abilities have grown
in such a short time?

05:57.410 --> 05:59.830
That's incredible, even for you.

06:09.130 --> 06:13.140
I'd like to get my adventurer 
rank up to around C.

06:13.700 --> 06:15.140
This will do.

06:15.140 --> 06:17.320
Goblin slaying?

06:17.320 --> 06:19.330
We can do this as a day trip.

06:19.330 --> 06:22.480
Um, would it be all right if I joined you?

06:22.940 --> 06:25.050
I don't mind, but are you sure?

06:25.050 --> 06:28.550
Yes. I'll take care of my 
remaining work once I return.

06:28.550 --> 06:29.410
Work?

06:29.410 --> 06:33.610
I'm investigating the Raluah Forest 
where you held your duel the other day.

06:33.610 --> 06:36.660
To make sure it's regrowing properly.

06:37.160 --> 06:40.130
Mind if I tag along?

06:40.130 --> 06:42.490
What? You could, but...

06:42.490 --> 06:46.550
Since I was part of that duel, 
I want to check it out.

06:47.050 --> 06:49.680
In that case, I'd love to have you.

06:53.970 --> 06:56.100
We'll each take one. Got it?

06:56.100 --> 06:56.810
Roger!

07:06.120 --> 07:07.880
And that's one job done.

07:10.440 --> 07:14.950
Incredible. We made a mess of this place, 
but it's already back to normal.

07:15.240 --> 07:20.210
We're going to examine the regenerated trees 
and look for anything unnatural in the area.

07:20.540 --> 07:23.630
If you spot any unusual herbs growing, 
please pick them.

07:25.840 --> 07:26.960
Let's see...

07:32.390 --> 07:35.650
We finished the job. 
Mind confirming it for us?

07:35.650 --> 07:39.950
Very well. Also, I have a message for you.

07:39.950 --> 07:40.850
What is it?

07:41.250 --> 07:47.200
It's from Barlux, guild master 
of our Bayrelicht branch.

07:47.200 --> 07:49.110
Barlux? Isn't that...

07:51.200 --> 07:54.260
I've been summoned 
by the palace in Bayrelicht.

07:54.260 --> 07:56.450
It says to head there as soon as possible.

07:56.800 --> 07:59.580
What does the palace want with you?

07:59.910 --> 08:01.350
Don't ask me.

08:01.350 --> 08:03.390
You don't have any ideas?

08:03.390 --> 08:04.080
None.

08:06.920 --> 08:10.050
Well, okay, maybe one.

08:10.380 --> 08:14.050
I might have to take care of this
before working on my rank.

08:14.490 --> 08:15.490
I'll join you.

08:15.490 --> 08:16.550
So will I.

08:17.860 --> 08:22.060
I wish I could go with you, 
but I can't leave the country.

08:22.060 --> 08:24.400
Don't make that face.

08:24.400 --> 08:26.550
There's something I want to give Wolfgang.

08:26.550 --> 08:29.440
Could you let me know when he's free?

08:29.440 --> 08:32.820
You have something for my father?

08:36.930 --> 08:39.770
Father, do you have a moment?

08:39.770 --> 08:41.740
Shin wishes to speak with you.

08:42.140 --> 08:43.860
Show him in.

08:45.330 --> 08:47.360
Sorry to interrupt.

08:47.360 --> 08:50.040
Don't be. This is also part
 of my kingly duties.

08:50.460 --> 08:52.590
Now, more importantly, what brings you here?

08:52.870 --> 08:57.530
Sorry for the short notice, but I need 
to leave for Bayrelicht right away.

08:57.530 --> 09:00.300
I thought I'd give you these before I go.

09:02.930 --> 09:04.100
Those are...

09:06.840 --> 09:08.810
Girart's Death Moon.

09:08.810 --> 09:11.110
I've already changed the owner.

09:11.560 --> 09:14.560
You can transfer them to whoever you want.

09:14.560 --> 09:17.110
I'd heard they were destroyed in your duel.

09:17.110 --> 09:19.680
I'm the one who made Death Moon.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.260
Repairing them was nothing.

09:21.820 --> 09:22.620
Besides,

09:23.180 --> 09:28.000
Girart asked me to give them to you 
once the duel was over.

09:28.570 --> 09:31.240
The first king wanted me to...

09:31.880 --> 09:34.880
Mind making sure they're good to go?

09:35.490 --> 09:36.380
Very well.

09:37.880 --> 09:40.390
These are unbelievable!

09:42.890 --> 09:46.390
It's up to you who inherits them next.

09:50.430 --> 09:53.050
I accept that responsibility.

10:00.160 --> 10:02.530
Okay, let's head back.

10:02.530 --> 10:03.870
You intend to teleport?

10:03.870 --> 10:06.160
Perhaps to where the Moon Sanctum was?

10:06.160 --> 10:10.920
Yeah. A wagon would take too long, 
and that area is safe.

10:10.920 --> 10:14.540
Another crystal? How extravagant.

10:14.540 --> 10:16.440
All right. Here we go.

10:22.940 --> 10:24.520
Someone's watching.

10:24.520 --> 10:26.930
I'm glad I used a stealth skill.

10:27.380 --> 10:31.690
Perhaps they think the Moon Sanctum 
will reappear in this spot.

10:32.210 --> 10:35.940
People must have long forgotten
 that it could be moved.

10:37.370 --> 10:39.660
Y-You won't disappear, will you, Shin?

10:39.660 --> 10:40.220
What?

10:40.890 --> 10:47.050
I just... grew a bit nervous that
that day may come again.

10:47.940 --> 10:49.190
Schnee.

10:49.190 --> 10:50.560
It's unfounded, isn't it?

10:52.580 --> 10:53.840
You're going to be left behind.

10:53.840 --> 10:55.050
Oh, sorry.

10:55.050 --> 10:57.760
Hey, wait. I'm the one Barlux summoned.

10:57.760 --> 11:00.110
So why are you just standing there?

11:00.110 --> 11:06.350
I couldn't imagine what it's like to wait 
for someone who might never return.

11:06.640 --> 11:09.480
I'm not sure I could do it.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.450
You couldn't.

11:10.450 --> 11:11.610
That was quick!

11:11.610 --> 11:15.480
Elves and humans have totally 
different perceptions of time.

11:15.480 --> 11:18.040
If we wanted to wait, why wouldn't we?

11:18.040 --> 11:19.250
Is that how it works?

11:19.250 --> 11:20.860
Yes, it is.

11:20.860 --> 11:25.870
For long-lived species like us, losing our 
reason to live is the gateway to hell.

11:25.870 --> 11:29.120
So thinking about it too hard 
gets you into trouble...

11:29.470 --> 11:34.290
That's right. If you're going to think, 
put your mind to something more useful.

11:34.290 --> 11:38.260
Besides, it throws me off 
when you suddenly get serious.

11:38.600 --> 11:41.760
Could you not make it sound like I'm cavalier
about everything all the time?

11:42.600 --> 11:45.510
You do get serious 
about the strangest things, Shin.

11:46.100 --> 11:47.100
Shaddup.

11:48.740 --> 11:51.060
Shin, it's good to see you again!

11:51.520 --> 11:54.850
I received a summons from the guild master.

11:54.850 --> 11:57.520
We'll let him know you're here. 
One moment, please.

11:57.940 --> 11:59.630
Cilica, could you go get him?

11:59.630 --> 12:00.960
Sure thing!

12:02.050 --> 12:03.910
Do you know what this is about?

12:04.170 --> 12:08.420
No. We're not told that much.

12:08.420 --> 12:12.550
But I did expect you'd be summoned soon.

12:12.550 --> 12:13.930
What? Why?

12:13.930 --> 12:17.170
Because you're hardly an ordinary adventurer.

12:17.660 --> 12:19.170
Of course...

12:19.520 --> 12:24.180
You're always traveling with beautiful women.

12:25.570 --> 12:28.050
I-I have male acquaintances, too!

12:28.330 --> 12:31.560
Oh? I've never seen you speaking to one before.

12:31.560 --> 12:34.600
That can't be true. There's, uh...

12:34.600 --> 12:36.360
Oh, right! Wilhelm!

12:36.360 --> 12:38.110
We've worked together before.

12:38.110 --> 12:38.820
What?

12:41.090 --> 12:43.820
Is that true, Shin?

12:44.150 --> 12:47.420
It wasn't an official job, but yeah.

12:48.130 --> 12:50.330
Why did everyone go quiet?

12:50.330 --> 12:53.980
He rarely forms parties.

12:53.980 --> 13:00.340
They say his combat strength is S-rank, 
but there are many rumors about him.

13:00.850 --> 13:03.290
Folks find him difficult to approach.

13:03.290 --> 13:06.310
Yeah, he's easily misunderstood.

13:06.310 --> 13:10.590
Wilhelm himself is an 
exceptional man, however.

13:10.590 --> 13:12.300
Can say that again.

13:12.300 --> 13:13.490
Shin!

13:14.880 --> 13:17.930
We're ready for you. This way, please.

13:21.170 --> 13:22.860
You're here sooner than expected.

13:23.420 --> 13:25.610
I was already headed this way.

13:26.140 --> 13:29.870
Sorry to rush you. This is Arahd the mage.

13:30.500 --> 13:33.620
I am Arahd Royl. A pleasure.

13:34.330 --> 13:37.290
He appraises gems for the guild.

13:37.290 --> 13:41.380
He assessed the Skullface gem 
you brought in as well.

13:42.100 --> 13:44.880
My name is Shin. It's nice to meet you.

13:45.300 --> 13:49.890
As I said in my message,
the palace has summoned you.

13:50.190 --> 13:52.260
May I ask why?

13:52.530 --> 13:54.020
Before that, I have a question.

13:55.390 --> 14:00.810
Are you aware that a sword 
flew into the palace?

14:00.810 --> 14:04.360
I heard <i>something</i> flew into it...

14:04.360 --> 14:06.440
About that...

14:06.440 --> 14:09.280
It was a massive white sword.

14:09.780 --> 14:13.270
On top of that, it crashed into the bedroom

14:13.270 --> 14:15.450
of the second princess of Bayrelicht.

14:15.450 --> 14:18.420
It caused quite the stir.

14:18.720 --> 14:20.090
O-Oh?

14:20.730 --> 14:23.300
Fortunately, no one was hurt.

14:23.300 --> 14:25.420
The issue is the sword itself.

14:25.880 --> 14:31.170
Its elemental enchantment 
and base materials are quite impressive.

14:31.570 --> 14:35.840
Apparently, it's comparable 
to the kingdom's royal sword.

14:35.840 --> 14:37.680
That's amazing.

14:38.140 --> 14:45.290
The gem from the Skullface you defeated 
also possessed powerful mana.

14:45.290 --> 14:47.820
I heard it was a rather high level.

14:47.820 --> 14:49.680
G-Guess so.

14:51.660 --> 14:54.580
<i>They definitely know who's responsible.</i>

14:54.950 --> 14:58.330
How did you manage to figure out
 that I was involved?

14:58.330 --> 15:01.650
Someone was trying to find out what happened.

15:01.650 --> 15:04.090
They got wind of the gem, too.

15:04.360 --> 15:08.340
As its appraiser, I was asked 
to examine the sword as well.

15:08.340 --> 15:14.970
There were traces of mana left on it
distinct from the sword's own.

15:14.970 --> 15:18.580
It matched the mana from the gem.

15:19.440 --> 15:22.860
<i>So it's like fantasy DNA identification.</i>

15:23.290 --> 15:25.320
From there, they followed the trail.

15:25.320 --> 15:31.610
When they discovered you were the one 
who brought the gem, you were summoned.

15:31.610 --> 15:35.740
Given the circumstances, 
the guild couldn't keep your secret.

15:35.740 --> 15:39.210
Considering what they knew, 
you couldn't fool them anyway.

15:39.210 --> 15:40.500
That's not on you.

15:40.770 --> 15:44.770
Fortunately, because you had a letter 
of introduction from the Moon Sanctum,

15:44.770 --> 15:46.980
the situation isn't any worse.

15:46.980 --> 15:49.910
Now, getting down to business...

15:49.910 --> 15:54.510
The second princess, Her Highness Rionne 
herself, is the one who summoned you.

15:54.810 --> 15:55.660
What?

15:55.660 --> 15:59.490
This incident piqued her interest in you.

15:59.490 --> 16:04.020
Is she going to hold me responsible 
for nearly injuring royalty?

16:04.360 --> 16:07.020
No, you won't be punished for that.

16:07.330 --> 16:11.030
The princess has slain Skullfaces before.

16:11.460 --> 16:12.800
Based on her experience,

16:12.800 --> 16:15.150
she's convinced everyone that 
you'd have no choice

16:15.150 --> 16:17.030
but to use full force against it.

16:17.310 --> 16:22.540
I appreciate that, but then 
what exactly does she want from me?

16:22.790 --> 16:25.650
I don't know the answer to that either.

16:25.650 --> 16:28.920
Politicians are nasty creatures, after all.

16:32.650 --> 16:35.800
Anyway, that's what they told me.

16:36.160 --> 16:37.170
I see.

16:37.170 --> 16:40.680
You sent a sword flying into the palace? 
Why would you do that?

16:40.680 --> 16:43.000
It's not like I did it on purpose!

16:43.800 --> 16:44.940
So Shin's just amazing?

16:44.940 --> 16:47.150
In some ways, yes.

16:47.150 --> 16:51.670
Perhaps they wish to press you
 into their service

16:51.670 --> 16:54.200
or have you marry an important noble.

16:54.200 --> 16:55.700
M-Marry?!

16:55.700 --> 17:00.580
Yes. They say a nation's power is proportional
to its high-ranking chosen ones.

17:01.100 --> 17:03.830
I believe they'll aggressively 
try to recruit you.

17:04.090 --> 17:06.640
I suddenly don't feel like going anymore.

17:06.640 --> 17:09.950
I doubt there's any problem with you 
refusing to enter their service.

17:09.950 --> 17:10.840
Really?

17:10.840 --> 17:14.690
As your party members, 
we'd suffer a great loss if you left.

17:14.690 --> 17:17.090
That should be reason enough 
to turn them down.

17:17.090 --> 17:19.880
But on the other hand, 
if they want to marry me off...

17:19.880 --> 17:24.100
Refusing stuff like that without 
a good reason only causes more trouble.

17:24.100 --> 17:28.230
On that front, you could tell them
 I am your fiancée.

17:28.230 --> 17:30.980
Hey, yeah, I could say I'm already spoken for.

17:31.270 --> 17:35.170
Depending on the circumstances, 
you could even say you're betrothed to Tiera.

17:35.170 --> 17:36.880
T-To me?

17:36.880 --> 17:38.620
Oh, would you not like that?

17:39.250 --> 17:41.740
As long as we're just pretending...

17:43.200 --> 17:45.500
Then Yuzuha will be Shin's fiancée, too!

17:45.500 --> 17:47.520
Wait, Yuzuha. We can't do that!

17:47.520 --> 17:48.750
It'd destroy me socially!

17:49.540 --> 17:50.810
We're just pretending.

17:50.810 --> 17:53.250
It's only make-believe. It's not for real.

17:53.250 --> 17:55.130
You're not going to mate with Schnee?

17:55.130 --> 17:58.380
H-Hey! Don't say stuff like that in that form!

17:58.380 --> 17:59.100
Mate...

17:59.640 --> 18:01.850
Why don't we all calm down?

18:04.890 --> 18:08.320
I've been summoned by the second princess.

18:08.320 --> 18:09.270
My name is Shin.

18:09.590 --> 18:11.160
I've been expecting you.

18:11.160 --> 18:14.040
I'll retrieve your escort. One moment, please.

18:14.040 --> 18:15.300
Understood.

18:16.530 --> 18:19.280
I wonder what's going to show up...

18:22.520 --> 18:26.070
Excuse me. You're Shin
 the adventurer, aren't you?

18:26.070 --> 18:27.550
Yes, that's me.

18:27.550 --> 18:32.390
I am Gadras. Princess Rionne 
asked me to fetch you.

18:32.390 --> 18:34.420
I'll show you the way. Come with me.

18:34.890 --> 18:35.930
Understood.

18:39.380 --> 18:40.930
<b>Dark Knight</b>

18:39.380 --> 18:40.930
<b>Gadras Jarre</b>

18:40.930 --> 18:43.230
<i>Level 188...</i>

18:43.230 --> 18:45.930
<i>They sent one of the kingdom's 
most powerful men to meet me.</i>

18:46.550 --> 18:50.440
We're here. Princess Rionne is just inside.

18:52.060 --> 18:55.160
It's Gadras. I've brought Shin.

18:55.160 --> 18:55.940
Enter.

19:07.410 --> 19:08.770
Thank you for coming.

19:08.770 --> 19:13.460
I am Rionne Sytrail Bayrelicht, 
second princess of this kingdom.

19:13.900 --> 19:15.340
It's a pleasure to meet you.

19:15.650 --> 19:20.210
My name is Shin. 
Thank you for inviting me today.

19:20.210 --> 19:23.270
I care little for etiquette.

19:23.270 --> 19:24.970
Feel free to call me Rionne.

19:24.970 --> 19:27.220
Very well, Rionne.

19:27.620 --> 19:30.470
Your Highness, that's hardly proper
for someone you've just met.

19:30.470 --> 19:31.960
You've confused him.

19:31.960 --> 19:34.870
We may fight side by side eventually.

19:34.870 --> 19:38.110
It beats building walls 
just because I'm royalty.

19:38.110 --> 19:41.290
I beg your pardon, Shin,
 but this is simply how she is.

19:41.290 --> 19:42.490
No need for formality.

19:42.790 --> 19:46.490
Uh, may I ask why I was summoned?

19:46.800 --> 19:52.000
I'm sure Barlux gave you an overview, 
but it's about the Skullface.

19:59.600 --> 20:01.260
You recognize this, don't you?

20:01.740 --> 20:05.260
That's the sword the Skullface was wielding.

20:05.530 --> 20:08.010
I imagine it was quite strong.

20:10.630 --> 20:15.360
Well, yes. My own weapon 
was destroyed in the battle.

20:15.640 --> 20:16.810
I see.

20:17.110 --> 20:19.360
<i>At least that much is true.</i>

20:20.120 --> 20:21.860
I knew you were different.

20:21.860 --> 20:24.110
Different, you say?

20:24.540 --> 20:30.040
Most adventurers like you who suddenly 
distinguish themselves are chosen ones.

20:34.240 --> 20:37.590
When we determine one to be rather powerful,

20:37.590 --> 20:39.880
we typically summon you here.

20:40.260 --> 20:44.770
Some have used the opportunity 
to plot assassinations.

20:44.770 --> 20:46.560
How frightening.

20:46.560 --> 20:50.010
Some suspected you would as well, 
but you seem safe.

20:50.010 --> 20:53.390
I don't recall saying anything 
that would clear such suspicions.

20:53.390 --> 20:55.900
Of course you didn't. 
I'm going off my instincts.

20:55.900 --> 20:56.900
What?

20:57.210 --> 20:58.400
You've shown your colors.

20:58.400 --> 21:04.680
I mean, I doubt anyone would
accept that without more concrete proof.

21:04.680 --> 21:08.380
That's not a problem.
I possess the skill "Intuition."

21:08.380 --> 21:11.790
My hunches have never been wrong.

21:11.790 --> 21:14.370
<i>Is that how Intuition works?</i>

21:14.810 --> 21:18.540
<i>Is the Intuition skill 
enhancing her woman's intuition?</i>

21:18.550 --> 21:20.950
Well, the most decisive factor was that

21:20.950 --> 21:23.800
you possess a letter of introduction 
from the Moon Sanctum.

21:24.250 --> 21:29.320
Schnee wouldn't grant one
to anyone who'd plot an assassination.

21:29.320 --> 21:32.060
This was more like a final check.

21:32.060 --> 21:35.690
I see. So, now we get down to business?

21:35.990 --> 21:38.310
Yes. Allow me to be direct.

21:40.590 --> 21:43.070
<i>Is it marriage after all?!</i>

21:43.920 --> 21:46.820
Shin, I want you to fight me!

21:50.290 --> 21:51.100
What?

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time
Episode 10
<b>Demon</b></b>
